# Agent

- PySide6 UI: Sign In, Break In, Break Out, Sign Out; **LIVE red blink** in corner while tracking; BREAK state amber; clear last sync.
- Capture: mouse click count, key press count, foreground window title, screenshots on interval; idle after ~3 min no input.
- Never hook clipboard or record key characters.
- SQLite outbox + retry. Offline must keep recording; sync when API reachable.
- Screenshot: scale down, JPEG quality cap; skip while idle by default.
- Fail closed on disk full: stop new screenshots, keep punch events.
- Run from tray; survive CAD fullscreen; do not steal focus every minute.
- Theme black/yellow per `docs/14-ui-theme.md`. Windows 10/11 only for v1.
